  "Dónde te situó la evaluación, sesión a sesión.": "m516554626a50",
  "Where the grader placed you, session by session.": "m516554626a50",
  "Precisión": "m6c8b29a0a1f3",
  "Accuracy": "m6c8b29a0a1f3",
  "La frecuencia de tus errores por cada 100 palabras, para que hablar más no te perjudique.": "m929361876235",
  "How often you make mistakes, measured per 100 words so talking more never counts against you.": "m929361876235",
  "Vocabulario": "m6002766a4ef3",
  "Vocabulary": "m6002766a4ef3",
  "Cuántas palabras conoces, su variedad y cuánto van más allá del inglés cotidiano.": "m43082cd3a6a8",
  "How many words you know, how varied they are, and how far past everyday English they reach.": "m43082cd3a6a8",
  "Oraciones": "m5a2790e45aa2",
  "Sentences": "m5a2790e45aa2",
  "No si son largas, sino si tienes más de una estructura disponible.": "m6ff09af7cca7",
  "Not \"are they long\" — whether you have more than one sentence shape available to you.": "m6ff09af7cca7",
  "Expresión oral": "m80ac4d45bcf0",
  "Delivery": "m80ac4d45bcf0",
  "Cómo construyes tu habla, no cómo suena. No se mide pronunciación a partir de una transcripción.": "m9d2ce0662722",
  "How you speak, not how you sound. Pronunciation is not measured here and never will be from a transcript.": "m9d2ce0662722",
  "Participación": "m467e02c33c52",
  "Engagement": "m467e02c33c52",
  "Si conduces la conversación o solo respondes.": "mb8b6c7bc9ac1",
  "Whether you drive the conversation or only answer it.": "mb8b6c7bc9ac1",
  "Errores por tipo": "m1bc71a1cfed3",
  "Mistakes by type": "m1bc71a1cfed3",
  "Cada tipo de error a lo largo del tiempo. Un hueco es una sesión demasiado breve para evaluar; cero significa que se evaluó sin errores.": "m02feee5000c7",
  "Each kind of mistake over time. A gap is a session too short to grade; a zero is a session graded clean.": "m02feee5000c7",
  "Nivel por sesión": "mb3f09db2597a",
  "Level per session": "mb3f09db2597a",
  "La estimación de cada sesión. Cambia con el tema; por eso el nivel principal es un promedio ponderado y no esta línea.": "m4175fc73ba44",
  "The grader’s read on each individual session. It bounces around with the topic — which is exactly why the level at the top of this page is a weighted average and not this line.": "m4175fc73ba44",
  "Precisión gramatical": "m3a2a9b986070",
  "Grammar accuracy": "m3a2a9b986070",
  "Errores por cada 100 palabras. Menos es mejor.": "md231c140c19d",
  "Mistakes per 100 words. Lower is better.": "md231c140c19d",
  "Palabras distintas usadas": "m6a12523609f7",
  "Distinct words used": "m6a12523609f7",
  "Palabras distintas que has usado, acumuladas en todas las sesiones.": "m23031a7c40e3",
  "Distinct words you have used, adding up across every session.": "m23031a7c40e3",
  "Palabras nuevas por sesión": "m63dead1f4197",
  "First-use words per session": "m63dead1f4197",
  "Palabras que no habías usado antes. Se estabilizan si dejas de explorar, aunque el total siga subiendo.": "m7a9992b86d41",
  "Words you had never used before. This is the one that flattens when you stop stretching — the total above keeps climbing regardless.": "m7a9992b86d41",
  "Amplitud de vocabulario": "md6cf57c7b4f3",
  "Vocabulary range": "md6cf57c7b4f3",
  "Proporción de tus palabras que van más allá del inglés cotidiano.": "mb7bb5e344a97",
  "Share of your words that go beyond everyday English.": "mb7bb5e344a97",
  "Variedad de palabras": "m1e01f2ae2bb8",
  "Word variety": "m1e01f2ae2bb8",
  "Si usas palabras distintas o repites siempre las mismas. Se mide en una ventana fija, para que hablar más no reduzca la cifra.": "md0c6632abcbd",
  "Whether you reach for different words or circle the same twenty. Measured in a fixed window, so talking more does not drag it down.": "md0c6632abcbd",
  "Longitud de oraciones": "md51a77f203b2",
  "Sentence length": "md51a77f203b2",
  "Promedio de palabras por oración. Más largo no significa mejor: se informa, no se califica.": "m773a7c020ea9",
  "Average words per sentence. Longer is not automatically better — this one is reported, not scored.": "m773a7c020ea9",
  "Complejidad de oraciones": "m8b1107453759",
  "Sentence complexity": "m8b1107453759",
  "Proporción de oraciones con una subordinada como because, although o which. Hace visible el paso de A2 a B1.": "ma2cd6c283b47",
  "Share of sentences using a clause like \"because\", \"although\" or \"which\". This is the move from A2 to B1, made visible.": "ma2cd6c283b47",
  "Variedad de oraciones": "m641e6abdac6f",
  "Sentence variety": "m641e6abdac6f",
  "Cuánto varía la longitud de tus oraciones. Usar siempre ocho palabras o siempre veinticinco resulta monótono.": "m350148eb934e",
  "How much your sentence length varies. Nothing but eight-word sentences and nothing but twenty-five-word sentences are both monotonous, and only this notices.": "m350148eb934e",
  "Ritmo al hablar": "mb9d211e2aebd",
  "Speaking pace": "mb9d211e2aebd",
  "Palabras por minuto mientras hablabas. Se informa, no se califica: más rápido no es necesariamente mejor.": "mdd4d05c6d9c7",
  "Words per minute while you were actually talking. Reported, not scored — faster is not better, and a rising line here is only good news up to a point.": "mdd4d05c6d9c7",
  "Vacilaciones": "m56bf386bd35d",
  "Hesitations": "m56bf386bd35d",
  "Um, you know, like: por cada 100 palabras. Menos es mejor.": "meef9712183ae",
  "\"Um\", \"you know\", \"like\" — per 100 words. Lower is better.": "meef9712183ae",
  "Autocorrecciones": "m7cc66624b98d",
  "Self-corrections": "m7cc66624b98d",
  "Corregir tu propio error a mitad de frase, por cada 100 palabras. Se informa sin calificar: escucharte es buena señal, y no tener errores que corregir también.": "m9edaab190863",
  "Catching your own mistake mid-sentence, per 100 words. Reported, not scored: it is a good sign that you are hearing yourself, and so is having nothing left to correct.": "m9edaab190863",
  "Preguntas que haces": "mc153d4e582e5",
  "Questions you ask": "mc153d4e582e5",
  "Proporción de tus intervenciones que hacen preguntas. El tutor suele preguntar, así que puedes conversar mucho sin formar preguntas propias; es una habilidad aparte.": "m81e735257d09",
  "Share of your turns that ask something. Ahmad ends every turn with a question, so you can hold a long conversation without ever forming one yourself — and forming questions is its own skill.": "m81e735257d09",
