  "Elige un tema y un objetivo oral. Confírmalos para iniciar.": "m5c6501aedad1",
  "Choose a topic and an oral goal. Confirm them to start.": "m5c6501aedad1",
  "Recupera vocabulario y estructuras pendientes sin leer respuestas.": "m9e0623a2ed6d",
  "Retrieve pending vocabulary and structures without reading answers.": "m9e0623a2ed6d",
  "Conversa sobre tu experiencia sin preparar vocabulario antes.": "mc841779feb58",
  "Talk about your experience without preparing vocabulary first.": "mc841779feb58",
  "Selecciona una estructura y vocabulario que realmente hayas necesitado.": "mbb944ae48a7d",
  "Choose a structure and vocabulary you actually needed.": "mbb944ae48a7d",
  "Lee la tarjeta gramatical y produce ejemplos propios en contextos nuevos.": "m7cea82ceb312",
  "Read the grammar card and produce your own examples in new contexts.": "m7cea82ceb312",
  "Elige un video breve en inglés y confirma duración y reproducción.": "md0c9c4d7f911",
  "Choose a short English video and confirm its duration and playback.": "md0c9c4d7f911",
  "Escucha sin transcripción e identifica tema e idea principal.": "m63efaf777e72",
  "Listen without a transcript and identify the topic and main idea.": "m63efaf777e72",
  "Escucha otra vez, identifica detalles y expresiones útiles.": "ma4364cf722f3",
  "Listen again and identify details and useful expressions.": "ma4364cf722f3",
  "Repite un fragmento comprendido, primero con audio y luego sin él.": "m156832002360",
  "Repeat a passage you understand, first with audio and then without it.": "m156832002360",
  "Explica lo escuchado con tus propias palabras y aplícalo a tu experiencia.": "ma0811b21943e",
  "Explain what you heard in your own words and apply it to your experience.": "ma0811b21943e",
  "Desarrolla narraciones, opiniones y problemas usando lo trabajado.": "ma7a878bb0d3c",
  "Develop narratives, opinions and problems using what you practised.": "ma7a878bb0d3c",
  "Completa las tarjetas de vocabulario y una transferencia nueva.": "meaf835998852",
  "Complete the vocabulary cards and a new transfer task.": "meaf835998852",
  "Da una respuesta final sin notas y revisa evidencias y próximos repasos.": "mb85875a6ed7e",
  "Give a final answer without notes and review evidence and upcoming reviews.": "mb85875a6ed7e",
  "Preséntate y describe tu rutina y actividades actuales en inglés.": "m96f0fc395be4",
  "Introduce yourself and describe your routine and current activities in English.": "m96f0fc395be4",
  "Narra acciones pasadas y realiza la tarea indicada de terminaciones -ed.": "m2c9d9ced93da",
  "Describe past actions and complete the requested -ed endings task.": "m2c9d9ced93da",
  "Explica planes y predicciones en inglés.": "mcd0e9d226ec9",
  "Explain plans and predictions in English.": "mcd0e9d226ec9",
  "Resuelve un problema y contrasta palabras con tus propios ejemplos.": "ma4fc18cd1efd",
  "Solve a problem and compare words using your own examples.": "ma4fc18cd1efd",
  "Desarrolla una opinión o narración y responde preguntas imprevistas.": "m174ce9589022",
  "Develop an opinion or narrative and answer unexpected questions.": "m174ce9589022",
  "Pide aclaración y describe una palabra sin nombrarla.": "mf926ab914f11",
  "Ask for clarification and describe a word without naming it.": "mf926ab914f11",
  "Revisa las evidencias y objetivos; el nivel es provisional.": "m6d2be6063987",
  "Review the evidence and goals; the level is provisional.": "m6d2be6063987",
  "Describe las mismas 3–4 acciones de una rutina en presente durante 1 minuto.": "m77bff034908a",
  "Describe the same 3–4 routine actions in the present for 1 minute.": "m77bff034908a",
  "Narra esas mismas acciones como pasado terminado durante 2 minutos.": "mec30d9c2e284",
  "Retell those same actions as a finished past event for 2 minutes.": "mec30d9c2e284",
  "Exprésalas como experiencia hasta hoy en present perfect durante 2 minutos.": "m86be7b5c7f58",
  "Describe them as experience up to now in the present perfect for 2 minutes.": "m86be7b5c7f58",
  "Practica los tres marcos temporales con una segunda rutina durante 2 minutos.": "m51ce64b60543",
  "Practise the three time frames with a second routine for 2 minutes.": "m51ce64b60543",
  "Habla usando anclajes temporales y circunloquio. Pausa entre ideas sin apresurarte.": "mf2c449480837",
  "Speak using time anchors and circumlocution. Pause between ideas without rushing.": "mf2c449480837",
  "Escucha 5 minutos de material real en inglés, sin subtítulos en español.": "mfa9941303fba",
  "Listen to 5 minutes of real English material, without native-language subtitles.": "mfa9941303fba",
  "Sintetiza el argumento del hablante con tus palabras durante 3 minutos.": "m01d444c17431",
  "Summarise the speaker's argument in your own words for 3 minutes.": "m01d444c17431",
  "Expresa tu postura y contrástala con tu experiencia durante 3 minutos.": "m2e542f7f7dd5",
  "Express your position and compare it with your experience for 3 minutes.": "m2e542f7f7dd5",
  "Aplica PREP: punto, razón, ejemplo y cierre. Tienes 4 minutos.": "m47adf4f0f8fd",
  "Apply PREP: point, reason, example, point. You have 4 minutes.": "m47adf4f0f8fd",
  "Elige una pregunta abierta y unas pocas palabras clave, sin escribir un guion.": "md837577ff420",
  "Choose an open question and a few keywords, without writing a script.": "md837577ff420",
  "Desarrolla tu argumento durante 4 minutos. Indica cuándo terminaste.": "mc18675da0993",
  "Develop your argument for 4 minutes. Say when you have finished.": "mc18675da0993",
  "Descansa y respira durante 30 segundos; no es tiempo de producción oral.": "m08f4aa67b24b",
  "Rest and breathe for 30 seconds; this is not speaking time.": "m08f4aa67b24b",
  "Repite las mismas ideas en 3 minutos, reduciendo divagaciones.": "maa43bce3aabd",
  "Repeat the same ideas in 3 minutes, cutting digressions.": "maa43bce3aabd",
  "Descansa otros 30 segundos y confirma cuándo estés listo.": "m1df21521980b",
  "Rest for another 30 seconds and confirm when ready.": "m1df21521980b",
  "Expresa el núcleo de las mismas ideas en 2 minutos.": "m697f00e0491a",
  "Express the core of the same ideas in 2 minutes.": "m697f00e0491a",
  "Produce 60–90 segundos sin preparar, revisa la transcripción y dos errores prioritarios; ensaya y transfiere a otro contexto.": "mf34321ce6a71",
  "Speak spontaneously for 60–90 seconds, review the transcript and two priority errors; rehearse and transfer to another context.": "mf34321ce6a71",
  "Tiempos verbales": "m4e010c5083a5",
  "Verb tenses": "m4e010c5083a5",
  "Cuenta lo que hiciste el fin de semana en pasado y repítelo como si ocurriera ahora. Cambiar conscientemente ayuda a fijar los tiempos.": "m5c3408ac8e8d",
  "Tell a story about your weekend in the past tense, then tell it again as if it were happening right now. Switching deliberately makes the tenses stick.": "m5c3408ac8e8d",
  "Concordancia de sujeto y verbo": "mad1d686aa162",
  "Subject–verb agreement": "mad1d686aa162",
  "Describe lo que hacen otras personas: 'he works', 'she takes', 'they run'. Presta atención a la -s de la tercera persona singular.": "m0753ea304a05",
  "Practice describing what other people do — 'he works', 'she takes', 'they run'. Third-person singular is where the -s goes missing most.": "m0753ea304a05",
  "Artículos (a / an / the)": "m495bf7b4c272",
  "Articles (a / an / the)": "m495bf7b4c272",
  "Describe los objetos de tu habitación con 'a' o 'the'. Pregúntate si quien escucha ya sabe a qué objeto te refieres.": "mf9211f7088b3",
  "Describe the room you're in out loud, naming every object with 'a' or 'the'. Ask yourself each time: does the listener already know which one I mean?": "mf9211f7088b3",
  "Preposiciones": "mbf3468a09817",
  "Prepositions": "mbf3468a09817",
  "Aprende las preposiciones en frases completas, como 'depend ON' o 'arrive AT', y vuelve a utilizarlas en conversación.": "mbe0390a5ec8b",
  "Prepositions rarely follow rules — they come in fixed pairs. Collect the ones you get wrong as whole phrases ('depend ON', 'arrive AT') and reuse them in conversation rather than memorising them.": "mbe0390a5ec8b",
  "Plurales y contabilidad": "maa93e36d8273",
  "Plurals and countability": "maa93e36d8273",
  "Practica los incontables difíciles: advice, information, furniture, news y research. Usa 'a piece of advice', no 'an advice'.": "m6366c29484ea",
  "Practice with the awkward uncountables — advice, information, furniture, news, research. Say 'a piece of advice' until 'an advice' starts to sound wrong.": "m6366c29484ea",
  "Orden de palabras": "m9209e24bc4e4",
  "Word order": "m9209e24bc4e4",
  "Respeta el orden sujeto-verbo-objeto. Practica los adverbios: 'he is always late', no 'always he is late'.": "mbfe762d273c0",
  "English holds subject-verb-object hard. Practice placing adverbs — 'he is always late', not 'always he is late' — since that's where word order usually slips.": "mbfe762d273c0",
  "Formación de preguntas": "m59edb96c3ec4",
  "Forming questions": "m59edb96c3ec4",
  "Haz cinco preguntas seguidas al tutor. Presta atención a la inversión entre sujeto y auxiliar, especialmente cuando hablas rápido.": "m6b7471181bb6",
  "Ask Ahmad five questions in a row on purpose. Questions invert the subject and auxiliary, and that inversion is easy to skip when you're speaking fast.": "m6b7471181bb6",
  "Pronombres": "m06aadf33f07a",
  "Pronouns": "m06aadf33f07a",
  "No omitas el sujeto: el inglés lo necesita incluso en 'it is raining', aunque tu idioma no lo requiera.": "mb4b62110282e",
  "Watch for the dropped subject — English needs one even when it means nothing ('it is raining'). Many languages don't, so this transfers straight across.": "mb4b62110282e",
  "Verbos modales": "mdcb5537e126d",
  "Modal verbs": "mdcb5537e126d",
  "Después de un modal va el verbo sin 'to': 'must go', no 'must to go'. Habla de obligaciones y posibilidades de tu vida.": "m1377a0c68032",
  "A modal is always followed by a bare verb: 'must go', never 'must to go'. Practice talking about obligations and possibilities in your own life.": "m1377a0c68032",
  "Condicionales": "m17959790717e",
  "Conditionals": "m17959790717e",
  "Explora situaciones hipotéticas: ganar dinero, mudarte al extranjero o empezar de nuevo. Practica qué harías en cada caso.": "m0c0d7293cdf2",
  "Talk through hypotheticals — what you'd do if you won money, moved abroad, could start over. Conditionals only get comfortable when the topic is imaginary.": "m0c0d7293cdf2",
  "Elección de palabras": "m9eff4456482f",
  "Word choice": "m9eff4456482f",
  "Aprende las combinaciones naturales: 'make a mistake' o 'turn on the light'. Fíjate en la pareja, no solo en la palabra.": "m3972d4fdb8c7",
  "These are collocations — words that habitually travel together. 'Make a mistake', 'turn on the light'. Notice the pairing, not the individual word.": "m3972d4fdb8c7",
  "Comparativos y superlativos": "mbfe8672c8a0b",
  "Comparatives and superlatives": "mbfe8672c8a0b",
  "Compara ciudades o comidas. Las palabras cortas suelen usar -er/-est y las largas more/most, nunca ambos a la vez.": "m10b8d9752c74",
  "Compare things out loud — cities you've lived in, food you've eaten. Short words take -er/-est, long words take more/most, and never both at once.": "m10b8d9752c74"
}
